From e536469d0c7910f5b40823c86eea380a6259eb56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:30:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(release): optionally sign and notarize the macOS
 packages

Scope the Developer ID and notary inputs to the packaging step. Use a temporary keychain and publish only complete ZIP and DMG artifacts. Keep the ad-hoc release path without credentials.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #1642
